flowchart TD
    A([Start]) --> B[Initialize SQLite database]
    B --> C[Load dashboard and expense records]
    C --> D{User action}
    D -->|Add expense| E[Validate date, category, description and amount]
    E --> F{Valid input?}
    F -->|No| G[Show validation message]
    G --> D
    F -->|Yes| H[Save record to SQLite]
    H --> I[Refresh totals and table]
    I --> D
    D -->|Search| J[Filter saved records]
    J --> D
    D -->|Delete| K[Confirm and delete selected record]
    K --> I
    D -->|Export CSV| L[Write records to CSV file]
    L --> D
    D -->|Exit| M([End])
